          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1342721376}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions:
        - player: 0
          character: {fileID: 1829091632}
          emotes: 0
          duration: 0
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 2
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1829091632}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Magandang araw, Bayani! Sa unang anim na kabanata ng Noli Me Tangere,
            makikita natin ang buhay sa bayan ng San Diego at kung paano umiiral
            ang kapangyarihan, panliligalig, at pag-ibig sa lipunan. Pansinin ninyo
            ang mga tauhan, ang kanilang posisyon, at ang mga unang palatandaan ng
            katiwalian.
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins: []
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 0
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1829091632}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Good day, class!
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1829091632}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: "Today, we are going to talk about a very interesting and important
            topic \u2014 the thematic analysis of Chapters 1 to 5 of Noli Me Tangere.
            This lesson is important because it helps us understand not only the
            story, but also the social issues and historical realities that Rizal
            wanted to expose during his time"
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 2051746737}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1913322866}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1342721376}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1342721376}
          direction: 2
          walk: 0
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 1
      interval: 1
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1829091632}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 7096670327494543431, guid: 1189e97e912249f40a9ba9cf596f1aea, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Ngayon ay sisimulan natin ang unang bahagi ng iyong paglalakbay sa
            Noli Me Tangere
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 2051746737}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1913322866}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1342721376}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 0
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1829091632}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 4146786208365501868, guid: 3963256cc1b186c41a9d912c94fcd164, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: Makikita natin dito ang tema ng kapangyarihan at status sa lipunan.
            Si Kapitan Tiyago ay gumagamit ng kayamanan at koneksyon sa simbahan
            upang tumaas ang kanyang katayuan.
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1829091632}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 1335385452945238478, guid: ffcea649099c2b945a8914d4efeb7128, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: Dito naman lumilitaw ang tema ng pag-ibig at alaala. Ipinapakita
            nito ang damdamin ni Ibarra at ang kanyang pagkakaugnay sa nakaraan at
            sa kabutihan ng kanyang pamilya.
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1829091632}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 4633355498211079068, guid: f6717a2679d1bce4db62770a6cc869dc, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: Ang larawang ito ay sumisimbolo sa kawalang-katarungan at pagdurusa.
            Makikita ang epekto ng kolonyal at makapangyarihang mga tauhan sa mga
            ordinaryong tao sa San Diego.
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 2051746737}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1913322866}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1342721376}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 0
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1829091632}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 7096670327494543431, guid: 1189e97e912249f40a9ba9cf596f1aea, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: This is the end of our discussion
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1829091632}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 7096670327494543431, guid: 1189e97e912249f40a9ba9cf596f1aea, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: "Now you must search for 10 hidden scrolls. Each scroll contains
            trivia from Chapters 1 to 5. Collect them all, and you will unlock the
            quiz to prove what you\u2019ve learned"
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 2051746737}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
